  },
  "description": "Login, user, role, membership, and permission changes from mssql_security_ddl (300s, last 4 days, cap 10000). source=xe is the observability_security_ddl Extended Events session and includes the actor. source=catalog is create/modify date only, so Login is a hyphen. GRANT/DENY/REVOKE and role membership come from the default trace. client_host is the XE client hostname or the default-trace host; catalog rows show a hyphen. A zero event count is healthy only when Default Trace is 1. XE Session 0 means modern CREATE/ALTER/DROP has no actor yet. event_time is SQL Server local time. Unix UTC is mssql_security_ddl_event_timestamp_seconds.",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [
